---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="The Success of PT DPSA Group at IFEX 2026 | Dharma Putra Sejahtera Abadi"
>
  <Navbar isSolid={true} />

  <main class="pt-32 pb-24 min-h-[calc(100vh-80px)] bg-[#fdfdfd]">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 mb-12">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <a
        href="/articles"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent-orange hover:gap-4 transition-all font-bold tracking-widest text-[0.65rem] uppercase group mb-10"
      >
        <span
          class="material-icons-outlined text-sm group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform"
          >arrow_back</span
        >
        <span>Back to Articles</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Header Section -->
      <header class="mb-14 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-orange/10 text-accent-orange text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-6"
        >
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-orange animate-pulse"
          ></span>
          Event Highlights
        </div>
        <h1
          class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-secondary mb-6 italic leading-tight tracking-tight"
        >
          The Success of PT DPSA Group at IFEX 2026
        </h1>
        <p
          class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-500 font-light italic max-w-2xl mx-auto"
        >
          Blending Natural Beauty with Modern Manufacturing Technology
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Hero Image -->
      <div
        class="relative w-full mb-20 rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-secondary/10 group"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-secondary/5 mix-blend-multiply transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-0 duration-700 z-10"
        >
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/article/revisi 1.png"
          alt="IFEX 2026 Success"
          class="w-full object-cover max-h-[75vh] group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out"
        />
        <!-- Optional overlay gradient for cinematic feel -->
        <div
          class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent z-10"
        >
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Container -->
      <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Lead Paragraph -->
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-loose mb-16 text-xl font-light">
          <span
            class="float-left text-7xl font-display font-bold text-accent-orange leading-none mr-4 mt-2"
            >T</span
          >
          <strong>angerang, March 2026</strong> &ndash; PT DPSA Group has resoundingly
          concluded its participation in the prestigious international furniture exhibition,
          the Indonesia International Furniture Expo (IFEX) 2026. Held at ICE BSD
          City, Tangerang, from March 5th to 8th, the event served as an instrumental
          strategic platform to solidify PT DPSA Group's standing as a formidable
          player in the global furniture industry.
        </p>

        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-24 relative"
        >
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <h2
              class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-secondary mb-6 leading-tight"
            >
              Exclusive Collection: The Harmony of Teak Wood and Sofa Comfort
            </h2>
            <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-accent-orange mb-8 rounded-full"></div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 text-lg font-light">
              At Hall 10, Booth 19, PT DPSA Group showcased a premier lineup of
              our finest loose furniture products. Our primary focus was to
              highlight the undeniable strength and intrinsic aesthetic beauty
              of Indonesian Teak Wood, seamlessly integrated with our
              high-quality sofa collection. Through these exemplary products, we
              conclusively demonstrated that local Indonesian materials possess
              a unique character capable of competing decisively on the
              international stage.
            </p>
            <div
              class="p-6 bg-zinc-50 border-l-4 border-accent-orange rounded-r-xl shadow-sm"
            >
              <p class="text-secondary font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                "Each unit on display reflects our unwavering dedication to
                detail, absolute comfort, and the unparalleled character of
                Indonesian timber."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full relative">
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-accent-orange/5 rounded-[2rem] transform translate-x-4 translate-y-4 -z-10"
            >
            </div>
            <img
              src="/images/article/revisi 2.png"
              alt="Exclusive Collection"
              class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-[2rem] shadow-xl border border-white"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <div
          class="mb-24 bg-white p-10 md:p-14 rounded-[2rem] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] border border-zinc-100"
        >
          <div class="text-center mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
              Large-Scale Project Solutions Powered by Cutting-Edge Technology
            </h2>
            <p class="text-slate-500 font-light text-lg">
              Beyond showcasing the aesthetic beauty of our furniture, our
              participation in IFEX 2026 served as a strategic launchpad to
              introduce the superior production infrastructure of PT DPSA Group.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p
            class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 text-lg font-light text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto"
          >
            We are immensely proud to inform our esteemed partners and
            prospective buyers that our facilities are now equipped with a
            robust, comprehensive suite of modern, high-tech machinery. This
            technological advancement empowers us to deliver:
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-10">
            <div
              class="bg-zinc-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-100/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group"
            >
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-accent-orange shadow-sm mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
              >
                <span class="material-icons-outlined">domain</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-secondary mb-2">Project Capacity</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-light text-slate-500">
                The supreme capacity to fulfill extensive furniture requirements
                for healthcare, hotels, resorts, and corporate complexes.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div
              class="bg-zinc-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-100/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group"
            >
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-accent-orange shadow-sm mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
              >
                <span class="material-icons-outlined">bolt</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-secondary mb-2">
                Efficiency & Accuracy
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-light text-slate-500">
                Advanced automation guarantees timely delivery and consistent,
                laser-focused precision in every product detail.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div
              class="bg-zinc-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-100/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group"
            >
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-accent-orange shadow-sm mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
              >
                <span class="material-icons-outlined">verified_user</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-secondary mb-2">Proven Expertise</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-light text-slate-500">
                A reinforcement of our extensive, successful track record in
                managing diverse large-scale projects globally.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <header class="mb-12 text-center">
            <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
              High Enthusiasm from Local and International Visitors
            </h2>
            <p
              class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg font-light max-w-3xl mx-auto"
            >
              Throughout the four-day event, the PT DPSA Group booth in Hall 10
              received an overwhelming response. We observed unparalleled levels
              of enthusiasm from both local visitors and global buyers. The
              intense discussions regarding future project collaborations serve
              as a testament to the immense trust placed in our production
              capacity and design quality.
            </p>
          </header>

          <!-- Grid of 4 Images -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-16">
            <div
              class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-zinc-100/50"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/article/1.png"
                alt="Visitor Engagement 1"
                class="w-full h-auto hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
            <div
              class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-zinc-100/50"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/article/2.png"
                alt="Visitor Engagement 2"
                class="w-full h-auto hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
            <div
              class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-zinc-100/50"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/article/3.png"
                alt="Visitor Engagement 3"
                class="w-full h-auto hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
            <div
              class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-zinc-100/50"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/article/4.png"
                alt="Visitor Engagement 4"
                class="w-full h-auto hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Call to Action -->
          <div
            class="bg-secondary text-white rounded-[2rem] p-10 text-center relative overflow-hidden"
          >
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/images/pattern.svg')] opacity-5"
            >
            </div>
            <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
              <span
                class="material-icons-outlined text-4xl text-accent-orange mb-4 opacity-80"
                >workspace_premium</span
              >
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-4 italic">
                Building the Future of the Indonesian Furniture Industry
              </h3>
              <p class="text-zinc-300 font-light mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                The presence of PT DPSA Group at IFEX 2026 is a testament to our
                unwavering commitment to elevating Indonesia's reputation
                globally. We look forward to sharing our next wave of
                innovations with you!
              </p>
              <a
                href="https://wa.me/6281128507788"
                target="_blank"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-accent-orange hover:bg-white hover:text-accent-orange text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-accent-orange/20"
              >
                <span class="material-icons-outlined text-sm">chat</span>
                Start A Project
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
